  "worked_solution": "The terms of the expression are $-2p$, $-4q$ and $9r.$  Looking at each term individually, we see that\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-2p$ is $-2$,\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-4q$ is $-4$, and\n\n- the coefficient of the term $9r$ is $9.$\n\nSo, the coefficients of the expression are $-2$, $-4$ and $9.$",
